| !Run for ioquake3 on RISC OS
| RISC OS port, copyright David Sharp 2026, GPL 2
| The game data goes beside !RunImage: baseq3 (Quake III Arena), demoq3
| (the free demo) or another game's folder.
Set ioquake3$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IfThere <ioquake3$Dir>.!Sprites Then IconSprites <ioquake3$Dir>.!Sprites

| --- Runtime support ----
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error ioquake3 needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later (from PackMan)
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 Error ioquake3 needs ARMEABISupport 1.03 or later (from PackMan)
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.03 RMLoad <ioquake3$Dir>.PThrTicker

| --- Sound: SharedSoundBuffer if it's in !System, else DigitalRenderer.
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer
RMEnsure DigitalRenderer 0.55 IfThere System:Modules.DRenderer Then RMLoad System:Modules.DRenderer
RMEnsure VideoOverlay 0.00 IfThere System:Modules.VideoOverlay Then RMLoad System:Modules.VideoOverlay

| The game: Quake III Arena (baseq3) if it's here, else OpenArena (baseoa),
| else the free Quake III Arena demo (demoq3).
Set ioquake3$Game ""
IfThere <ioquake3$Dir>.demoq3.pak0/pk3 Then Set ioquake3$Game demoq3
IfThere <ioquake3$Dir>.baseoa.pak0/pk3 Then Set ioquake3$Game baseoa
IfThere <ioquake3$Dir>.baseq3.pak0/pk3 Then Set ioquake3$Game baseq3
Dir <ioquake3$Dir>
| The heap is a dynamic area, so the slot only holds the program.
If "<ioquake3$Game>"<>"" Then WimpSlot -min 24000K -max 24000K
If "<ioquake3$Game>"="baseq3" Then Run <ioquake3$Dir>.!RunImage +set fs_basepath . +set fs_homepath . %*0 >/<ioquake3$Dir>/stdout 2>/<ioquake3$Dir>/stderr
If "<ioquake3$Game>"="baseoa" Then Run <ioquake3$Dir>.!RunImage +set fs_basepath . +set fs_homepath . +set com_basegame baseoa %*0 >/<ioquake3$Dir>/stdout 2>/<ioquake3$Dir>/stderr
If "<ioquake3$Game>"="demoq3" Then Run <ioquake3$Dir>.!RunImage +set fs_basepath . +set fs_homepath . +set com_basegame demoq3 %*0 >/<ioquake3$Dir>/stdout 2>/<ioquake3$Dir>/stderr
| No game data: the launcher offers to download the free demo, then starts
| the game through this file again. (Last, so nothing here runs after it.)
If "<ioquake3$Game>"="" Then WimpSlot -min 6144K -max 6144K
If "<ioquake3$Game>"="" Then Run <ioquake3$Dir>.Launcher %*0 2>/<ioquake3$Dir>/launcherlog
